2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (From\040Local\040Explanations\040to\040Global\040Understanding\040with\040Explainable\040AI\040for\040Trees\056)
/Author (Scott\040M\056\040Lundberg\054\040Scott\040M\056\040Lundberg\054\040Gabriel\040G\056\040Erion\054\040Hugh\040Chen\054\040Alex\040J\056\040DeGrave\054\040Jordan\040M\056\040Prutkin\054\040Bala\040G\056\040Nair\054\040Ronit\040Katz\054\040Jonathan\040Himmelfarb\054\040Nisha\040Bansal\054\040Su\055In\040Lee)
/Subject (Tree\055based\040machine\040learning\040models\040such\040as\040random\040forests\054\040decision\040trees\040and\040gradient\040boosted\040trees\040are\040popular\040nonlinear\040predictive\040models\054\040yet\040comparatively\040little\040attention\040has\040been\040paid\040to\040explaining\040their\040predictions\056\040Here\040we\040improve\040the\040interpretability\040of\040tree\055based\040models\040through\040three\040main\040contributions\056\040\0501\051\040A\040polynomial\040time\040algorithm\040to\040compute\040optimal\040explanations\040based\040on\040game\040theory\056\040\0502\051\040A\040new\040type\040of\040explanation\040that\040directly\040measures\040local\040feature\040interaction\040effects\056\040\0503\051\040A\040new\040set\040of\040tools\040for\040understanding\040global\040model\040structure\040based\040on\040combining\040many\040local\040explanations\040of\040each\040prediction\056\040We\040apply\040these\040tools\040to\040three\040medical\040machine\040learning\040problems\040and\040show\040how\040combining\040many\040high\055quality\040local\040explanations\040allows\040us\040to\040represent\040global\040structure\040while\040retaining\040local\040faithfulness\040to\040the\040original\040model\056\040These\040tools\040enable\040us\040to\040\0501\051\040identify\040high\055magnitude\040but\040low\055frequency\040nonlinear\040mortality\040risk\040factors\040in\040the\040US\040population\054\040\0502\051\040highlight\040distinct\040population\040subgroups\040with\040shared\040risk\040characteristics\054\040\0503\051\040identify\040nonlinear\040interaction\040effects\040among\040risk\040factors\040for\040chronic\040kidney\040disease\040and\040\0504\051\040monitor\040a\040machine\040learning\040model\040deployed\040in\040a\040hospital\040by\040identifying\040which\040features\040are\040degrading\040the\040model\220s\040performance\040over\040time\056\040Given\040the\040popularity\040of\040tree\055based\040machine\040learning\040models\054\040these\040improvements\040to\040their\040interpretability\040have\040implications\040across\040a\040broad\040set\040of\040domains\056\040Tree\055based\040machine\040learning\040models\040are\040widely\040used\040in\040domains\040such\040as\040healthcare\054\040finance\040and\040public\040services\056\040The\040authors\040present\040an\040explanation\040method\040for\040trees\040that\040enables\040the\040computation\040of\040optimal\040local\040explanations\040for\040individual\040predictions\054\040and\040demonstrate\040their\040method\040on\040three\040medical\040datasets\056)
/Keywords (17\040Jan\0402020\054\040Nature\040Machine\040Intelligence\054\040Decision\040tree\054\040Interpretability\054\040Tree\040\050data\040structure\051\054\040Population\054\040Random\040forest\054\040University\040of\040Washington\054\040Microsoft)
>>
endobj
